From 7698b84bf0cc2e639e3b3e396f3950b15dd45ec6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:38:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: add Faraday FA626TE CPU and GalaChip GC1601
 platform

FA626TE is an ARMv5TE core with aliasing VIPT caches and 32-byte lines.
Add the processor, cache and copy-page glue, and hook the GalaChip
GC1601 machine directory (arch/arm/mach-galachip) into the ARM build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm/Kconfig                  |  2 ++
 arch/arm/Kconfig.platforms        |  2 +-
 arch/arm/Makefile                 |  2 ++
 arch/arm/boot/compressed/head.S   |  6 ++++++
 arch/arm/include/asm/barrier.h    |  2 +-
 arch/arm/include/asm/glue-cache.h |  2 +-
 arch/arm/include/asm/glue-proc.h  |  9 +++++++++
